SbtCosmo.Derivation.GroundOriginalAuditNonidentifiability.offsets_injective :
  Function.Injective SbtCosmo.Derivation.GroundOriginalOffsets.offsets
'SbtCosmo.Derivation.GroundOriginalAuditNonidentifiability.offsets_injective' depends on axioms: [propext,
